FARWA KA LAAL DILBAR-E-SHABBAR GUZARGAYA<br>
 DULHA LAHOO MEIN DOOB KE JUNGLE MEN MARGAYA<br>
<br>
QASIM KI LAASH DEKH KE DUSHMAN BHI KEH UTHAY,<br>
 LAGTA HAI JAISE CHAND ZAMEEN PAR UTAR GAYA<br>
<br>
TUKDEY BADAN KE DEKE BACHAYA HAI DEEN KO,<br>
 TERAH BARAS KE SIN MEIN BADA KAAM KAR GAYA<br>
<br>
ROTEY HUVE BAHAN SE YEH KEHNE LAGEY HUSSAIN,<br>
 ZAINAB HAMARE BHAI KA DILBAR GUZAR GAYA<br>
<br>
ROKAR HUSSAIN KEHTE THE QASIM KI LAASH PAR,<br>
 SAD HAIF MAIN HOON MERA LAAL MAR GAYA<br>
<br>
RANDH SALA PEHNEY BAITHI HAI KUCH DAIR KI DULHAN,<br>
 DULHAY KA JISM DASHT-E-BALA MEIN BIKHARGAYA<br>
<br>
JOONHI SIMTI LAFZAON MEIN DULHA KI ZAKHMI LAASH,<br>
 DAMAN UROOSEY FIKAR KA ASHKAON MEIN BHAR GAYA<br>
<br>
BAKSHISH HO MERI KEHDAIN JO SHABBIR AYE RASHEED ,<br>
 HAR LAFZ TERE NAUHE KA DIL MEIN UTAR GAYA..